    feat(bk7258): add OpenVela STA Wi-Fi transport

    Implement the BK7258 AP-side Wi-Fi netdev and its shared-memory transport to Armino CP.

    - Add fixed-width command/data ABI for STA connect, status, scan pages, and country.

    - Extend mailbox channels with RX backpressure, deferred descriptors, reset generations, and completion handling.

    - Preserve CP ownership of radio, WPA, association, EAPOL, and PHY while OpenVela owns STA IPv4/ARP.

    - Add direct-push TX/RX ownership handling, reset isolation, and scan result transport.

    - Enable NuttX IPv4, ARP, DHCP renewal, WAPI, ping, and automatic procfs mounting.

    Validated with AP -Werror, clean app_ab packaging, AP input hash comparison, and successful on-board Wi-Fi scan.

